    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever, sweats, or weight loss</td></tr><tr><td>Eyes</td><td>Negative</td><td>No change in vision with glasses</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Negative</td><td>No hearing difficulty in conversation</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain or lightheadedness on standing</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough or breathlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>Bowels regular with polyethylene glycol two or three times a week</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Catheter draining well; no blood or leakage</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Stiff knees in the mornings; no falls</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No skin breakdown or new lesions</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No weakness, numbness, or memory change</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood steady; PHQ-2 score 1</td></tr><tr><td>Endocrine</td><td>Negative</td><td>No thirst or heat intolerance</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>12 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

