    <code code="42348-3" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Advance directives"/>
    <title>Advance Care Planning</title>
    <text><paragraph>Building on the goals-of-care conversation six weeks ago, he named his health care agent today; the agent is recorded in the chart and is not named here. In his own words, what matters most is to keep writing and teaching, to stay at home among the people he loves, and not to be put to sleep for an operation unless there is no gentler choice. If he became seriously ill he would want treatment that could restore him to a life he values, including antibiotics and a hospital stay, but not prolonged life support without a reasonable hope of recovery. He wants to be told the truth about his condition. The plan will be reviewed if his health changes and at next year&apos;s visit. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
